Jer 28:1 , Hananiah prophesies falsely the return of the vessels, and of Jeconiah;
Jer 28:5 , Jeremiah, wishing it to be true, shews that the event will declare the true prophets;
Jer 28:10 , Hananiah breaks Jeremiah's yoke;
Jer 28:12 , Jeremiah tells of an iron yoke;
Jer 28:15 , and foretells Hananiah's death.
